[Music]  here we go again sony have revealed the  free games for us ps plus subscribers  for the month of september 2021. like  always we can download the following  games from the first tuesday of the  month which is the seventh first up is  overcooked all you can eat this is a  social game about running a restaurant  against the clock sounds simple i know  but in no time at all you'll be burning  all the food starting fires in the  kitchen and someone always forgets to  wash up i can guarantee you need strong  relationships with the people you play  with because overcooked gets stressful  quickly all you can eat is essentially  the entire collection of overcooked  games one and two and every single piece  of dlc and additional content thrown in  there's even new stuff just for this  edition including kitchens chefs and  challenges there's over 200 levels to  churn through on your way to the  platinum trophy overcooked won't be a  game you play daily after the first week  but dusting it off every month or so to  change up your gaming schedule is worth  the download i highly recommend adding  this to your collection and to confirm  overcooked all you can eat support cross  play so if your friends own this on pc  xbox or switch there's no barriers to  playing together game number two is  predator hunting grounds i've been  expecting this on ps plus for a year now  and finally it's here hunting grounds is  an asymmetric multiplayer game which  means there are more players on one side  than the other this time one player  becomes the predator and hunts down a  team of four special op soldiers  controlled by other real-life players  the ops team can win either by taking  out the predator or collecting intel and  eliminating a third faction a rebel  militia in the jungle controlled by ai  if you've played dead by daylight or  friday the 13th you'll get the core idea  here playing as the predator is  ridiculous fun as we have all the  gadgets from the movies including iconic  death animations playing as the soldiers  is a little less fun especially if they  don't play the objective i played  predator hunting grounds on release and  i have to admit it did not run very well  at all on ps4 and most reviews came out  at around 6 out of 10 but i've been  assured much work has gone into predator  over the last 12 months and it's a  better experience in 2021 so will you be  trying it please sound off in the  comments below and finally hitman 2 an  assassination simulation with everyone's  favorite slap heads agent 47 i adore  this franchise but the thing most new  players don't expect is how slow and  methodical hitman games are this is far  from a typical action game 47 must first  watch his targets finding their routines  and chances to take them out finding  disguises and blending in is actually  more important than the silver ballers  he carries the mastery of hitman is  eliminating a target in a way which  looks like an accident poisoning their  food dislodging a railing pushing them  into an oncoming f1 car they're very  subtle you'll be playing the same  missions over and over again to find  every way to off that person that's the  replay value of this game is finding  multiple ways to take them out and may i  recommend an exploding golf ball or  covering a target in cement there is a  story line in hitman but it's paper thin  so jump in wreck a few criminal  masterminds by dropping a toilet on  their heads and get out unseen job done  hitman 2 reviews average at 8 out of 10  so you know this is actually the highest  rated ps plus game we've had for a while  now definitely worth your time so there  we have it those were the games that  will get you through the month of  september 2021 are you happy sad  delighted or mad please leave a comment  to help this video get to other people  i'm adam you're awesome see ya

